This repository packages assistant-authored experimental code and measurement
infrastructure. It is not affiliated with Qwen, NVIDIA, vLLM, Red Hat, or the
DFlash authors. No claim of novelty is made for INT4, MTP, DFlash2, Marlin,
coarse/refine selection, or speculative decoding.

The experimental worker invokes the separately installed vLLM Marlin utilities,
PyTorch and NVIDIA CUDA runtime. Those projects retain their own licenses and
notices. No model weights or third-party implementation source are bundled.
Model checkpoints retain the licenses stated by their publishers.

research/archive contains original assistant-authored experiment scripts.
The package's modified worker is identified in docs/experimental.md.
